# Changelog

All notable changes to VOK Cookies are documented in this file.

## [2.0.0] — 2026-10-24

### Brand & architecture

- Rebuilt the popup UI from the v2 design prototype (392×640, light/dark tokens, bottom tab bar)
- New modular layout: `src/` shared modules + slim `popup/` shell + `background/` worker
- Version bump to **2.0.0**; badge accent aligned to prototype purple `#6B5CF0`

### Navigation

- Replaced top **Transfer** tab with bottom nav: **Cookies · Profiles · Tools**
- Tools hub for export/import, cleanup, and protected cookies

### Cookies tab

- Site card with live cookie count, security grade (Good / Fair / Poor), and score bar
- Quick stats: HTTPS, Secure, HttpOnly, Trackers
- Filters: All / Session / Secure / Tracking
- Expandable cookie rows with protect / copy / edit / delete
- Action bar: Export sheet, quick import, copy-all as header string

### Profiles

- One-tap **Switch** replaces site cookies (protected cookies are kept)
- Save current tab as a named profile from a bottom sheet
- Active profile badge and relative “updated” labels

### Tools & transfer

- Multi-format export: **JSON**, **Netscape**, **Header string**, **CSV**
- Scope: this site or all profiles; toggles for HttpOnly / expired
- Import review sheet with **Merge** or **Replace** modes
- Drag-and-drop onto the whole popup (`.json` / `.txt` / cookies.txt)
- Cleanup: delete expired, delete known trackers, clear site (optional backup)
- Protected cookies: safe from bulk delete and Clear

### Security

- Security report sheet (HTTPS, Secure, HttpOnly, trackers, expired)
- Known-tracker detection (`_ga`, `_gid`, `_fbp`, `_octo`, …)

### i18n

- Kept English / Khmer language switcher in the header

---

## [1.0.1] — 2026-03-17

### Added

- **Language Support**
  - Added Khmer language support
  - Added English language support
  - Added language switcher in the extension popup
  - Added language support to the extension popup

---

## [1.0.0] — 2026-03-16

### Added

- **Cookie Manager**
  - View all cookies for the current tab with search
  - Expand cookie rows to see full details (name, value, domain, path, expiry, SameSite)
  - Add new cookies (name, value, path, expiry, Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite)
  - Edit existing cookies inline
  - Delete individual cookies
  - Copy cookie value to clipboard

- **Profiles**
  - Save current tab cookies as a named profile
  - Load a saved profile into the current tab (apply cookies)
  - Delete profiles
  - Profile list shows domain, cookie count, and save date

- **Export**
  - Export current tab cookies as JSON file
  - Export all saved profiles as a single JSON file

- **Import**
  - Import cookies from JSON (with preview before applying)
  - Import profiles from JSON (merge with existing profiles)
  - **Drag-and-drop** support: drop a `.json` file onto the Cookies or Profiles import card
  - Choose File button for both import types

- **After import**
  - Current tab reloads automatically after applying a cookies import so the page uses the new cookies

- **UI / UX**
  - Dark theme with accent purple, clean cards and typography
  - Three tabs: Cookies, Profiles, Transfer
  - Toast notifications for success and errors
  - Extension badge shows live cookie count per tab
  - README with logo header, badges, and setup instructions

- **Project**
  - Chrome Extension Manifest V3
  - Background service worker for badge updates
  - Icon set (16, 32, 48, 128) generated via `tools/make-icons.js`
  - `resources/logo.png` for README branding

